# GROUP_ID bindings

No elastic execution binding at present. The course members are still governed by `../plan.md`.

> A binding stores only the elastic execution arrangement (a temporary track switch, a catch-up window, a
> cross-member interlock); it stores no course body text, course progress, or mastery. When a real binding
> appears, create `Rddd_COURSE_ID.md` in this directory per
> `main/50_playbook/course_group_rules.md` and keep this note file.
